## System Access Issues






























```mermaid

graph TD

A["Access Issue Detected"] --> B{"Permission Issue?"}

B -- Yes --> C["Verify [cFish.io](<http://cFish.io>) Credentials"]

B -- No --> D{"Platform Connection?"}

C --> E["Check System Access"]

E --> F{"Access Restored?"}

F -- No --> G["Contact DMT Support"]

F -- Yes --> H["Issue Resolved"]

D -- Yes --> I["Check Platform Connectivity"]

D -- No --> J["Contact Tech Lead"]

I --> K{"Connection OK?"}

K -- Yes --> H

K -- No --> G

```






























## Data Synchronization Issues






























```mermaid

graph TD

A["Sync Issue Detected"] --> B{"Data Mismatch?"}

B -- Yes --> C["Alert DMT Team"]

B -- No --> D["Check Platform Status"]

C --> E["Run Data Integrity Check"]

E --> F{"Issues Found?"}

F -- Yes --> G["Document in Notion"]

F -- No --> H["Monitor System"]

G --> I["Implement Fix"]

I --> J["Verify Resolution"]

D --> K{"All Systems Up?"}

K -- No --> L["System-wide Health Check"]

K -- Yes --> M["Check Integration Points"]

```






























## Platform Integration Emergency Protocol






























```mermaid

graph TD

A["System Issue Detected"] --> B{"Priority Level?"}

B -- RED --> C["Immediate Tech Lead Alert"]

B -- AMBER --> D["30min DMT Team Alert"]

B -- GREEN --> E["2hr Support Team Alert"]

C --> F["System-wide Health Check"]

D --> G["Run Data Integrity Checks"]

E --> H["Verify Platform Permissions"]

F --> I["Document in Notion"]

G --> I

H --> I

I --> J["Monitor Resolution"]

J --> K{"Issue Resolved?"}

K -- No --> L["Escalate to Next Level"]

K -- Yes --> M["Update Documentation"]

```






























## Communication System Verification






























```mermaid

graph TD

A["Communication Issue"] --> B{"System Type?"}

B -- "Live Chat" --> C["Test Direct Human Chat"]

B -- "AI Assistant" --> D["Verify AI Services"]

B -- "Video Conf" --> E["Check Video Systems"]

C --> F{"Connection OK?"}

D --> F

E --> F

F -- No --> G["Contact Support Team"]

F -- Yes --> H["Document Resolution"]

G --> I["Implement Fix"]

I --> J["Verify All Systems"]

J --> K{"All Working?"}

K -- No --> L["Escalate to Tech Lead"]

K -- Yes --> H

```